      "writtenOn": "2025-10-01T18:18:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should not get interrupt storm from the sensor, since they are based on the FIFO: the sensor raises it when there is at least one sample to process, and until the EC clear the interrupt register, no more interrupt will be sent. The interrupt frequency is therefore limited to the max ODR, 100Hz.",
      "revId": "24f8b34181dbfc9d284e50e15bf4d866fbe88b22",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
