      "writtenOn": "2025-10-01T18:18:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Check we still pass sensor tests like CTS and tast test: `tast run $DUT hardware.SensorIioserviceHard`.\n\nThe problem with \"force` mode is the EC may not be schedule fast enough and can send n samples at a time instead of one, for instance 2 samples every 20ms, when the host request one sample every 10ms (100Hz).",
